00:01:39,300 --> 00:01:40,400
Let's see.

48
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:42,800
Is this one going to be a pure strategy Nash equilibrium?

49
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:46,080
Looks pretty good, because player 1 is going

50
00:01:46,080 --> 00:01:47,100
to get 12 instead of 8.

51
00:01:47,380 --> 00:01:49,000
Player 2 is going to get 0 instead of negative 5.

52
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:49,800
So that one's good.

53
00:01:50,380 --> 00:01:51,680
And then this one here.

